    "short_description":  "\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eSingle-Phase LED Track Spotlight\u003c/strong\u003e with \u003cstrong\u003e40W\u003c/strong\u003e power, this GRAZ model in Black is characterized by: \u003cstrong\u003ePowerful, Selectable light 3CCT, CRI92, and manufactured with Bridgelux Chip.\u003c/strong\u003e Professional and versatile lighting for commercial and residential spaces.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003ePerfect as an accent light in any track lighting system, ideal for highlighting specific elements, with a primary beam angle of 100º.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cbr\u003eAdditionally, its \u003cstrong\u003eAkzoNobel paint\u003c/strong\u003e finish, a global company specialized in high-quality paints and coatings, certifies that this product has high-quality paint.\u003c/p\u003e",
